0	section	Starting off
0	section	Talking to Duke Horacio
1	line	Duke Horacio	Greetings. Welcome to my castle.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Have you any quests for me?
2	line	Player	Have you any quests for me?
2	line	Duke Horacio	Well, I wouldn't describe it as a quest, but there is something I could use some help with.
2	line	Player	What is it?
2	line	Duke Horacio	We were recently sorting through some of the things stored down in the cellar, and we found this old talisman.
2	box	The Duke shows you a talisman.
2	line	Duke Horacio	The Order of Wizards over at the Wizards' Tower have been on the hunt for magical artefacts recently. I wonder if this might be just the kind of thing they're after.
2	line	Duke Horacio	Would you be willing to take it to them for me?
2	select	Start the Rune Mysteries quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Sure, no problem.
3	line	Duke Horacio	Thank you very much. You'll find the Wizards' Tower south west of here, across the bridge from Draynor Village. When you arrive, look for Sedridor. He is the Archmage of the wizards there.
3	box	The Duke hands you the talisman.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	Not right now.
3	line	Duke Horacio	As you wish. Hopefully I can find someone else to help.
3	action	end
1	option	Where can I find money?
0	section	Talking to Duke Horacio again
