3	line	Duke Horacio	Did you take that talisman to Sedridor?
3	line	Player	No, I lost it.
3	line	Duke Horacio	Ah, well that explains things. One of my servants found it outside, and it seemed too much of a coincidence that another would suddenly show up.
3	line	Duke Horacio	Here, take it to the Wizards' Tower, south west of here. Please try not to lose it this time.
3	box	The Duke hands you the talisman.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has the talisman:
