1	line	Archmage Sedridor	Ah, {player}. How goes your quest? Have you delivered my research to Aubury yet?
1	line	Player	Yes, I have. He gave me some notes to give to you.
1	line	Archmage Sedridor	Wonderful! Let's have a look then.
1	cond	If the player has the notes:
2	box	You hand the notes to Sedridor.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Alright, let's see what Aubury has for us...
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Yes, this is it! The lost incantation!
2	line	Player	So you'll be able to access that essence mine now?
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	That's right! Because of you, our order finally has a proper source of rune essence again! Thank you, friend.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	If you ever want to access the essence mine yourself, just let me know. It's the least I can do.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	I will also share the incantation with others, including Aubury. When I do, I'll let them know that you are to be given unlimited access to the mine.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Oh, and you can have this air talisman back as well. I have no further need of it, and I'm sure you will find it useful.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	In case you didn't know, the talisman can be used to craft air runes. Just take it to the Air Altar south of Falador along with some rune essence.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Don't worry if you can't find the altar. The talisman can guide you there. You may find talismans for other altars as well while adventuring. They'll let you craft other types of rune.
2	line	Player	Great! Thanks!
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	My pleasure!
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Can you teleport me to the Rune Essence Mine?
2	option	Who else knows the teleport to the Rune Essence Mine?
2	option	Could you tell me about the old Wizards' Tower?
2	option	I'd better get going.
3	line	Player	I'd better get going.
3	action	end
